<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Apr 10 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Apr 10 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $911.11 million in the week to April 10 from $667.80 million the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     50.16		31.59</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     20.85		13.73</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  860.95	     636.21</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    217.55	     168.81</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	657.57	     488.06</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    253.54	     179.74</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
